TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution at 100C, initial pH 5, pe 4
SOLUTION 1 Hydrothermal
    temp 100
    pH   5
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn   1
    -water 1

RATES
Calcite_simple
-start
 10 SA = PARM(1)
 20 k = PARM(2)
 30 moles = k * SA * TIME
 40 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_simple
        -m0 1
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -steps 10 in 100
        -formula CaCO3 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kin.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
END
